      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The township’s name reflects the rolling hills that surround the area of Union County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hillside%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1885 the Kean family donated Morris Avenue land, helping found Newark Normal College, now Kean University.",
