      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hillside%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Hillside Historical Society, founded in the 1980s, runs the Woodruff House and Eaton Store Museum in the town’s oldest home.",
